      "side": 1,
      "message": "In theory we could split this CL into 2 CLs: 1) changing how `kLow` works (fixing https://crbug.com/402587902), and then 2) changing how `kMedium` works (addressing the regression observed on some platforms in the Canary+Dev field trials).  But I think it\u0027s okay to land those together - we wouldn\u0027t be able to differentiate their impact in field trials anyway.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 49,
        "startChar": 42,
        "endLine": 49,
        "endChar": 49
      },
      "revId": "5cbb0491fe056ba6df2e1f0c1f3c527c968c89c4",
